Coffee Shop Sales Dashboard — Excel
---

## Project Overview
An interactive Excel dashboard analyzing 6 months of coffee shop sales data across 3 New York City locations — Astoria, Hell's Kitchen, and Lower Manhattan. Built with Pivot Tables, Slicers, 
Power Query, and dynamic charts to surface actionable business insights beyond surface-level totals.

---

